cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the isanrice pipeline or data, also cite the software."
title: "isan-rice-yield-benchmark: leakage-safe, explainable rice yield forecasting, a ground-truth simulation benchmark for Northeast Thailand"
abstract: >-
  Process-informed simulation benchmark of main-season rice in 200 districts
  of Northeast Thailand over 18 seasons, storing the true yield components,
  with a leakage-safe rolling-origin pipeline: 81 features in eight groups,
  eight learners, a leakage audit, feature-group ablation, ground-truth
  recovery of grouped SHAP, in-season forecasting, conformal intervals and
  robustness over replicate worlds and scenarios.
type: software
